    L --> I
    F --> S[(Shared TripState)]
    H --> S
    A --> S
    M --> S
    F --> B[Budget Worker: gate]
    H --> B
    A --> B
    U -->|Daily food and transport estimates| B
    B <--> S
    B -->|Rejected: ask for cheaper options| M
    M -->|Re-plan / rebuild| F
    M -->|Re-plan / rebuild| H
    M -->|Re-plan / rebuild| A
    S --> I[Day-by-day itinerary + trace]
